[speaker 0] Lady in black

[msg MSG_001 speaker 0] // Lady in black
{F2 08 FF FF}{speed 6}{lipsync}...What's the matter,
{firstname 0}?
{wait}
---
{F2 08 FF FF}{lipsync}My master is resting right now.
{wait}

[msg MSG_001_002 speaker 0] // Lady in black
{F2 08 FF FF}{speed 6}{lipsync}...That's a very rare item that
you have there.
{wait}
---
{F2 08 FF FF}{lipsync}It's called the {color 1}Afterlife Bell{color 0}.
It has the power to resurrect
wandering souls.
{wait}

[msg MSG_002 speaker 0] // Lady in black
{F2 08 FF FF}{speed 6}{lipsync}I thought it was still hidden in
the Labyrinth of Amala...
{wait}
---
{F2 08 FF FF}{lipsync}A Manikin must have stolen it
and fled, in hopes of returning to
the Vortex World.
{wait}

[msg MSG_003 speaker 0] // Lady in black
{F2 08 FF FF}{speed 6}{lipsync}...Speaking of which,
{wait}
---
{F2 08 FF FF}{lipsync}do you know how Manikins are
born?
{wait}
---
{F2 08 FF FF}{lipsync}They are originally fragments of
human emotions...
{wait}
---
{F2 08 FF FF}{lipsync}that acquire physical form and
become sentient.
{wait}

[msg MSG_004 speaker 0] // Lady in black
{F2 08 FF FF}{speed 6}When the Conception took place,
Tokyo was purged of humans.
{wait}
---
{F2 08 FF FF}It was a necessary step toward
the rebirth of the world...
{wait}

[msg MSG_005 speaker 0] // Lady in black
{F2 08 FF FF}{speed 6}But, even after they died,
their souls lingered.
And likewise... their emotions.
{wait}
---
{F2 08 FF FF}Weak emotions dissipated instantly,
but strong ones remained...
{wait}

[msg MSG_006 speaker 0] // Lady in black
{F2 08 FF FF}{speed 6}Those emotions sought receptacles,
and found refuge in the substance
closest to life...
{wait}
---
{F2 08 FF FF}Earth. They merged with the earth
and took shape one after another.
{wait}
---
{F2 08 FF FF}For some, they became what they
longed to be... For others,
a side of them that they abhorred
surfaced.
{wait}

[msg MSG_007 speaker 0] // Lady in black
{F2 08 FF FF}{speed 6}Tokyo is currently in a state
of transition, awaiting the day
of creation.
{wait}
---
{F2 08 FF FF}Of all the things in this world,
some have ceased to exist,
while others are adapting to
the new world by changing form...
{wait}

[msg MSG_008 speaker 0] // Lady in black
{F2 08 FF FF}{speed 6}Human emotions became Manikins
and inhabited the Vortex World.
{wait}

[msg MSG_009 speaker 0] // Lady in black
{F2 08 FF FF}{speed 6}Creation is forbidden to them,
and their very existence will be
denied once the new world has been
born, but...
{wait}

[msg MSG_010 speaker 0] // Lady in black
{F2 08 FF FF}{speed 6}Some Manikins have possessed
exceptional strength.
{wait}

[msg MSG_011 speaker 0] // Lady in black
{F2 08 FF FF}{speed 6}If you bring them back to life
with the {color 1}Afterlife Bell{color 0},
{wait}
---
{F2 08 FF FF}they might join you and help you
during your journey, even if it's
only for a short while.
{wait}
---
{F2 08 FF FF}It's worth a try.
{wait}

[msg MSG_012 speaker 0] // Lady in black
{F2 08 FF FF}{speed 6}...I think it's time for you
to go back, {firstname 0}.
{wait}
---
{F2 08 FF FF}There are still things you have
to do...
{wait}

